<title>UK: IFC sets 100 million rand two-year bond.</title>
<headline>IFC sets 100 million rand two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.50 PCT MATURITY    22.JAN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.625   PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25 PCT  REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIP     0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
